      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11901246::web::022::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-sintered alloys have a fine, homogeneous, three-phase microstructure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11901246::web::022::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The three phases are a bcc-type phase, a C14 Laves phase, and a Ti-rich oxide.",
